 text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">答应了 OKX </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/Mercy_okx">@<!-- -->Mercy_okx</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> 做一期关于空投的 Space，已经拖了很久了，现在正好借着 Gas 低迷、市场冷清的时候，和那些依然深耕 Web3链上交互的的伙伴们，一起聊聊空投的道与术。
