<div dir="auto" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text-body font-normal"><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">4、撸毛的核心策略：如何筛选优质空投项目，你如何筛选优质的空投项目？ 最关注哪些指标？（如团队背景、代币经济模型、社区活跃度等）

丰密：优质项目的关注的指标：赛道、融资背景、生态布局、团队背景、链上数据、技术创新点等，当然还有市场能力，搞事能力，组局能力。</span> <button class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-normal text-brand hover:underline" type="button">Show more</button></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 empty:hidden"></div><div class="-mx-2 flex h-5 min-h-5 w-[calc(100%+16px)] items-center justify-between overflow-visible @container"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1" data-engagement-action="reply"><a class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] group inline-flex items-center rounded-full transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 hover:text-blue-500 text-secondary" aria-label="Reply" href="/KuiGas/status/1895505735179698252"><span class="relative isolate inline-flex items-center rounded-full before:-z-10 before:pointer-events-none before:absolute before:inset-0 before:rounded-full before:scale-[0.88] before:opacity-[0] before:transition-[opacity,scale] before:duration-[140ms] before:ease-[ease-out] group-hover:before:scale-100 group-hover:before:opacity-[1] motion-reduce:before:transition-none before:bg-blue-500/10 h-9 px-2.5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-[18px]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-reply-stroke" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.751 10c0-4.42 3.584-8 8.005-8h4.366c4.49 0 8.129 3.64 8.129 8.13 0 2.96-1.607 5.68-4.196 7.11l-8.054 4.46v-3.69h-.067c-4.49.1-8.183-3.51-8.183-8.01zm8.005-6c-3.317 0-6.005 2.69-6.005 6 0 3.37 2.77 6.08 6.138 6.01l.351-.01h1.761v2.3l5.087-2.81c1.951-1.08 3.163-3.13 3.163-5.36 0-3.39-2.744-6.13-6.129-6.13H9.756z"></path></svg><span class="inline-flex overflow-hidden" data-animated-count="true" style="opacity:1;width:auto;transform:none"><span class="inline-flex tabular-nums text-subtext2 ps-1"><span class="x-animated-count-visual inline-flex select-none" data-animated-count-visual="true" dir